      "old_line": 17,
      "exact_old_text": "- **PAYE and NASSIT operation** \u2014 Employers operate PAYE on employee salaries and contribute to the National Social Security and Insurance Trust (NASSIT) under the NASSIT Act 2001. Both PAYE and NASSIT are remitted monthly to the relevant authority.  _(NASSIT Act 2001)_",
